scripts\case-law-information-extraction\output\rules_high_confidence.csv:draftly-rule-courts-coa-1095-99-f.pdf-1,courts-coa-1095-99-f.pdf,,COA,,The burden of proving prescriptive title falls on the defendant where the legal title is in the plaintiff.,"It is settled law that where the legal title is in the plaintiff the burden of proving prescriptive title falls on the defendant (Siyanaris Vs Jayasinghe Udeni De Silva 52 NLR 289, Juliana Hamine Vs. Don Thomas 59 NLR 546, Sirajudeen and two others Vs. Abbas 1994 (2) SLR 365).",SRC071-s3,none,,False,verbatim,ratio,high,llm-extract,unverified
scripts\case-law-information-extraction\output\rules_high_confidence.csv:draftly-rule-courts-coa-13.-ca-phc-209_17-judgment.pdf-1,courts-coa-13.-ca-phc-209_17-judgment.pdf,,COA,,"A Magistrate cannot assume jurisdiction to hear and determine a case under Section 66 of the Primary Courts' Procedure Act if a civil action is pending in a District Court, unless there is a breach of peace.","If the mere institution of a suit in a civil Court is sufficient to divest the Magistrate of his jurisdiction, the whole purpose of Section 62 will be defeated. A scheming party will be enabled to play hide and seek",SRC001-s44,section-not-found,Section 62 of the Administration of Justice Law,False,verbatim,ratio,high,llm-extract,unverified
scripts\case-law-information-extraction\output\rules_high_confidence.csv:draftly-rule-courts-coa-c.a-dc-135-1999f-1.pdf-1,courts-coa-c.a-dc-135-1999f-1.pdf,,COA,1999,A party invoking the provisions of section 3 of the Prescription Ordinance to defeat an adverse claimant to immovable property must establish a starting point for their acquisition of prescriptive rights.,"Where a party invokes the provisions of section 3 of the Prescription Ordinance in order to defeat the ownership of an adverse claimant to immovable property, the burden of proof rests squarely and fairly on him to establish a starting point for his or her acquisition of prescriptive rights.",SRC071-s3,ok-unchecked,section 3 of the Prescription Ordinance,True,verbatim,ratio,high,llm-extract,unverified
