scripts\case-law-information-extraction\output\v1-backup\rules.csv:draftly-rule-courts-coa-ca_dc_rathnapura_729_00.pdf-1,courts-coa-ca_dc_rathnapura_729_00.pdf,,COA,,A possessor is always presumed to hold in his own right and as proprietor until the contrary be demonstrated.,A possessor is always presumed to hold in his own right and as proprietor until the contrary be demonstrated;,SRC071-s3,none,verbatim,ratio,high,llm-extract,unverified
