scripts\case-law-information-extraction\output\v1-backup\rules.csv:draftly-rule-courts-coa-ca_phc_263_2006.pdf-1,courts-coa-ca_phc_263_2006.pdf,,COA,2006,"A Magistrate's Court should not be turned into a forum for the settlement of civil disputes, yet, a Magistrate making an order under Section 431 must exercise his judicial discretion in ascertaining the person entitled to possession.","A Magistrate's Court should not be turned into a forum for the settlement of civil disputes, yet, a Magistrate making an order under Section 431 must exercise his judicial discretion in ascertaining the person entitled to possession.",SRC001-s1,ok-unchecked,verbatim,ratio,high,llm-extract,unverified
