scripts\case-law-information-extraction\output\v1-backup\rules.csv:draftly-rule-courts-sc-sc_appeal_101_2013-1.pdf-1,courts-sc-sc_appeal_101_2013-1.pdf,,SC,2013,"To establish title by prescription, it is required that the possession is held as a title adverse to or independent of that of the claimant or plaintiff.","It is necessary to inquire in what manner the person who had been in possession during the time held it, if he held in a character incompatible with the idea that the title remained in the claimant to the property it would follow that the possession in such character was adverse....",SRC071-s3,ok-unchecked,verbatim,ratio,high,llm-extract,unverified
