scripts\case-law-information-extraction\output\v1-backup\rules_high_confidence.csv:draftly-rule-courts-sc-sc_fr_13_2020.pdf-1,courts-sc-sc_fr_13_2020.pdf,,SC,2020,"A person who has agreed to purchase a house on an installment basis can be considered as having a main document in proof of residence, and is entitled to obtain full marks for that document.","When considering the totality of the evidence placed before this Court, I hold that the 1st Petitioner is entitled to obtain full marks to the document produce marked as 9A, the main document in proof of the Residence of the Petitioner.",SRC001-s4,ok-unchecked,verbatim,ratio,high,llm-extract,unverified
scripts\case-law-information-extraction\output\v1-backup\rules_high_confidence.csv:draftly-rule-courts-sc-sc_fr_15_2010.pdf-1,courts-sc-sc_fr_15_2010.pdf,,SC,2010,The minister must hold an inquiry as he thinks fit before making a decision to forfeit property.,It is a further requirement that the minister should hold such inquiry as he thinks fit before the decision is made.,SRC001-s2,ok-unchecked,verbatim,ratio,high,llm-extract,unverified
scripts\case-law-information-extraction\output\v1-backup\rules_high_confidence.csv:draftly-rule-courts-sc-sc_fr_24_2013.pdf-1,courts-sc-sc_fr_24_2013.pdf,,SC,2013,"Public authorities must conform to constitutional requirements, including Article 12, even in the sphere of contracts.","Law in Article 12 of the Constitution includes regulations, rules, directions, principles, guidelines and schemes that are designed to regulate public authorities in their conduct. In the context, whilst Article 12 erects no shield against merely private conduct, public authorities must conform to constitutional requirements , in particular to those set out in Article 12 even in the sphere of contract; and where there is a breach of contract and a violation of the provisions of Article 12 brought about by the same set of facts and circumstances, the aggrieved party cannot be confined to his remedy under the law of contract.",SRC002-s2,ok-unchecked,verbatim,ratio,high,llm-extract,unverified
